00:15:32,020 --> 00:15:36,217
learning all there is to know about King
Yami the Pharaoh and the Shadow Games.

249
00:15:36,300 --> 00:15:40,780
The key to his power is your puzzle
and the three Egyptian god cards.

250
00:15:41,180 --> 00:15:44,320
But I can't just take the
Millennium Puzzle from you.

251
00:15:44,540 --> 00:15:48,397
According to the ancient scriptures,
I have to defeat you in a duel first.

252
00:15:48,480 --> 00:15:50,717
Then I'll banish you to the Shadow Realm.

253
00:15:50,800 --> 00:15:52,360
But why would you do that?

254
00:15:52,580 --> 00:15:54,698
To make sure you stay out of my way.

255
00:15:55,240 --> 00:15:58,117
Once I gain control of
the Millennium Puzzle

256
00:15:58,200 --> 00:16:00,880
and obtain all three Egyptian God Cards,

257
00:16:01,060 --> 00:16:02,060
I'll be king!

258
00:16:02,320 --> 00:16:05,740
And a much more worthy king
than your counterpart, Yami.

259
00:16:06,120 --> 00:16:10,885
He doesn't even know how to harness the
great powers that lie dormant within him.

260
00:16:11,040 --> 00:16:14,746
I, on the other hand, know full
well how to take them from him.

261
00:16:15,840 --> 00:16:20,300
And my Millennium Rod will ensure
that I get everything I need.

262
00:16:20,540 --> 00:16:21,857
Who has the cards?

263
00:16:21,940 --> 00:16:25,480
I already possess two of
the Egyptian god cards,

264
00:16:25,620 --> 00:16:27,797
and I know where to find the third one.

265
00:16:27,880 --> 00:16:32,440
Soon enough, my loyal team of rare
hunters will bring the final card to me.

266
00:16:33,700 --> 00:16:36,877
It's only a matter of
time, you see. That is,

267
00:16:36,960 --> 00:16:40,177
until I take what is
rightfully mine and banish you

268
00:16:40,260 --> 00:16:43,637
and the former pharaoh to
the dreaded Shadow Realm,

269
00:16:43,720 --> 00:16:47,097
where you will spend all
of eternity while the

270
00:16:47,180 --> 00:16:50,121
rest of the world is
kneeling before King Merrick,

271
00:16:50,240 --> 00:16:51,500
the new pharaoh!

272
00:16:54,100 --> 00:16:57,260
You're powerless against me, little Yugi.

273
00:16:57,740 --> 00:16:59,680
My destiny can't be stopped.

274
00:16:59,880 --> 00:17:02,340
Don't you see it's only a matter of time?

275
00:17:02,600 --> 00:17:08,160
The three Egyptian god cards, along with
your Millennium Puzzle, will belong to me.

276
00:17:08,440 --> 00:17:13,320
Then I will strip the pharaoh of his ancient
powers and infuse them within myself.

277
00:17:13,820 --> 00:17:16,217
I have to keep Merrick from
getting all this power.

278
00:17:16,300 --> 00:17:19,997
I wish I knew more about Yami's ancient
past, because history is repeating itself,

279
00:17:20,080 --> 00:17:22,797
and it's my destiny to help
him save the world again.

280
00:17:22,880 --> 00:17:26,257
I do know that Merrick can't succeed
without the Millennium Puzzle,

281
00:17:26,340 --> 00:17:29,317
