he has to defeat me in a duel.

282
00:17:29,400 --> 00:17:33,137
So as long as I believe in the heart of
the cards and stay connected to Yami,

283
00:17:33,220 --> 00:17:34,260
I can stop him.

284
00:17:35,460 --> 00:17:36,290
Merrick,

285
00:17:36,373 --> 00:17:38,097
you'll never defeat me in a duel,

286
00:17:38,180 --> 00:17:41,180
so you'll never get your
greedy hands on my puzzle.

287
00:17:42,100 --> 00:17:44,520
I promise you, by the sands of Egypt,

288
00:17:45,340 --> 00:17:47,600
the Pharaoh's power will be mine.

289
00:17:48,440 --> 00:17:51,600
Another of my mind slaves
is already in Battle City,

290
00:17:51,720 --> 00:17:54,097
waiting to defeat you
and take your puzzle.

291
00:17:54,180 --> 00:17:56,900
And he holds an Egyptian god card.

292
00:17:57,680 --> 00:17:59,820
And what's the name of this card?

293
00:18:00,180 --> 00:18:02,700
You'll find out soon enough, little Yugi.

294
00:18:03,060 --> 00:18:05,380
Till then, beware the quiet one.

295
00:18:05,680 --> 00:18:07,137
What do you mean, Merrick?

296
00:18:07,220 --> 00:18:08,840
Who is the quiet one?

297
00:18:09,720 --> 00:18:11,600
We'll meet again, Yugi.

298
00:18:17,940 --> 00:18:21,980
I'm not afraid of you Next time,
show me your face, you coward

299
00:18:23,620 --> 00:18:25,397
Yugi, you all right, buddy?

300
00:18:25,480 --> 00:18:31,080
We're here Yugi Hey, guys
You're okay What happened here?

301
00:18:33,740 --> 00:18:37,217
Soon we will have Yugi's
Millennium Puzzle And the three

302
