Egyptian God Cards And how will
you get Obelisk from Kaiba?

303
00:18:40,940 --> 00:18:42,760
That's a simple task.

304
00:18:43,000 --> 00:18:44,059
I'm not concerned.

305
00:18:44,580 --> 00:18:49,420
Once Yugi is taken care of, I'll
strip Kaiba of his Egyptian god card.

306
00:18:50,360 --> 00:18:52,680
So you're going to duel Kaiba yourself?

307
00:18:53,400 --> 00:18:55,420
