308
00:18:55,660 --> 00:19:00,440
But like I said, my first concern
is Yugi and his Millennium Puzzle.

309
00:19:00,640 --> 00:19:02,777
And keep an eye on those friends of his.

310
00:19:02,860 --> 00:19:03,690
Right.

311
00:19:03,773 --> 00:19:06,020
I don't want them getting in my way.

312
00:19:06,440 --> 00:19:10,137
Actually, Odeon, they may
prove to be quite useful to me.

313
00:19:10,220 --> 00:19:13,280
I could always use more
servants to do my bidding.

314
00:19:16,260 --> 00:19:17,400
In the meantime,

315
00:19:17,760 --> 00:19:20,437
I'll use the Quiet One
to crush Yugi Moto in

316
00:19:20,520 --> 00:19:23,460
a duel and bring his
Millennium Puzzle to me.

317
00:19:29,540 --> 00:19:33,880
It's only a matter of time before
I possess the Millennium Puzzle,

318
00:19:34,000 --> 00:19:36,588
within which lies the
spirit of the Pharaoh.

319
00:19:36,940 --> 00:19:39,937
Then I'll combine the strength
of the Winged Dragon of Ra

320
00:19:40,020 --> 00:19:44,157
Slifer the sky dragon and the
soon to be mine obelisk the

321
00:19:44,240 --> 00:19:48,417
tormentor and in accordance
with the ancient scriptures the

322
00:19:48,500 --> 00:19:52,600
unlimited power of the pharaoh
himself will belong to me,

323
00:19:52,880 --> 00:19:58,620
the entire world will kneel at my feet
and no one will be able to stop me

